All three hard-preset oracles solved, so the script has entered its fixed-answer escalation path at `p=503`. The witness remains four integers; only the modulus and incidence haystack grow, so this is the permitted “grow the haystack, not the needle” axis.
diff --git a/gen_1011_3701.py b/gen_1011_3701.py
