+        "5.2 has a polynomial mechanical route here via Hopcroft-Karp "
+        "perfect matching in O(E sqrt(V)); selftest measures its shipping cost, "
+        "whereas the compact projective route uses at most 228 exact operations."
+    ),
+    "max_answer_tokens": 228,
+}
+
+
+NATIVE = {
